  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "While taking Immortal Gu from the sleeping immortal zombie Bo Qing, Fang Yuan draws this Gu out as the fifth Immortal Gu in that haul.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_bo_qing",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its speed is nearly on par with Qi Escape Immortal Gu of the same rank. In one recorded case, when Bo Qing was rank seven, a same-rank Gu Immortal used Qi Escape Immortal Gu to flee after three rounds; Bo Qing used this Gu to chase and did not catch him, though the distance was not reduced. Afterwards Bo Qing used the immortal killer move sword rampage, with this Gu as one of its core Immortal Gu, and cut off that enemy’s head.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "speed-and-bo-qings-chase",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_qi_escape_immortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While weighing whether to use this Gu to flee Domination Immortal Chu Du’s pursuit, Fang Yuan judges that it is fast but flies in a straight line, that he would have to stop in order to change direction, and that this is a major flaw. He rates it enough against an ordinary Gu Immortal but not against a Domination Immortal, and concludes that he needs at least an immortal killer move.",
        "chapters": [
          1058
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "judged-insufficient-against-chu-du",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chu_du"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan deduces the immortal killer move blood torrent while thinking about travelling and changing direction, to make up for this Gu’s flaw. Blood torrent’s linear speed is inferior because it uses only the rank six blood asset Immortal Gu, and it cannot surpass Sword Escape unless blood asset is raised to rank seven. Since a user who stops to change direction exposes a weakness a Domination Immortal would use in full, Fang Yuan plans to use the two alternately, and practises the pair for days, taking mortal Gu back out of blood torrent because he needs to activate it in the instant after Sword Escape stops.",
        "chapters": [
          1061
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-torrent-deduced-for-its-flaw",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_asset_immortal_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While transformed into an ancient sword dragon against Ye Lui Qun Xing, Fang Yuan’s transformation path dao marks turn into sword path dao marks and, added to his cultivation of sword eyebrows Immortal Gu, reach ten thousand. A thousand dao marks double an Immortal Gu’s power, so ten thousand sword path dao marks add ten times the power to this Gu, already an exceptional movement Gu worm among rank seven Immortal Gu. Ancient sword dragon, this Gu and the ten thousand sword path dao marks stacked together let Fang Yuan vanish from his spot, cross the whole battlefield before any immortal reacts, and appear in front of Ye Lui Qun Xing.",
        "chapters": [
          1204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "boosted-by-ten-thousand-dao-marks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ye_lui_qun_xing",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Testing his newly gained vajra thought Immortal Gu, Fang Yuan judges that a single vajra thought reaches half of this Gu’s own speed, and is satisfied with the result even though vajra thought is only rank six against this Gu’s rank seven.",
        "chapters": [
          1305
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "speed-benchmark-for-vajra-thought",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_vajra_thought_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
